{"id":"n42008-1-9","stage":4,"title":"단거리 · 短距离","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42008-1-9-1","ko":"너는 집에서 학교에 올 때 뭘 타고 와?","zh":"你从家里去学校的时候坐什么来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교에","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24817374ce6c7ab8eb01.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42008-1-9-2","ko":"단거리라 그냥 걸어 다녀.","zh":"距离很近，所以就走路过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"단거리라","meaning":"短距离，短程，短途","explanation":"단거리：短距离，短程，短途；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"단거리","audio":"/audio/f5f414dabf66c091fe47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42008","senseId":"1","lemma":"단거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸어","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀.","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f5f414dabf66c091","term":"단거리","zh":"短距离，短程，短途","audio":"/audio/f5f414dabf66c091fe47.mp3","entryId":"42008","definition":"短的距离。","pronunciation":["단ː거리"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e8fc9067cebfacb4d4b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.855,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42008","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6817,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你从家里去学校的时候坐什么来？","距离很近，所以就走路过去。","请下来帮我把车推一下吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你从家里去学校的时候坐什么来？","距离很近，所以就走路过去。","请下来帮我把车推一下吧。"],"answer":1}]}
